title: "[Beslisboom] PipelineBehaviorPattern.Rewrite" {shape: text; near: top-center; style: {font-size: 24; bold: true}}
direction: down
q1: "Expliciete interface-\nimplementatie?" {shape: diamond}
q2: "Task<T> + 3 parameters,\nnext is RequestHandlerDelegate<T>?" {shape: diamond}
q3: "Elk gebruik van next\nis next() of next(token)?" {shape: diamond}
q4: "async?" {shape: diamond}
q5: "Elke return next(...)\nof Task.FromResult?" {shape: diamond}
q6: "Request-type is typeparameter\nvan de klasse?" {shape: diamond}
q7: "Constraint al IRequest/INotification\n(of interface daarop)?" {shape: diamond}
m1: "Manual: explicit interface\n(explicit)"
m2: "Manual: does not have the form\n(geen proof)"
m3: "Manual: next is used other than\n(next-stored)"
m4: "Manual: not next() or Task.FromResult\n(next-passed)"
f1: "ValueTask + MessageHandlerDelegate,\nnext(request, token), where T : IMessage\n(open-async, no-constraint, new-constraint,\nnext-token, edge-notnull-constraint)"
f2: "ValueTask + MessageHandlerDelegate,\nnext(request, token), geen constraint\n(closed, edge-request-constraint)"
q1 -> m1: ja
q1 -> q2: nee
q2 -> m2: nee
q2 -> q3: ja
q3 -> m3: nee
q3 -> q4: ja
q4 -> q6: ja
q4 -> q5: nee
q5 -> m4: nee
q5 -> q6: ja
q6 -> q7: ja
q7 -> f1: nee
q7 -> f2: ja
q6 -> f2: nee
